ecord-257bm-i17"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-i17"],"id":"long.record-257bm-i17","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Proposition 6.126 (Changing one support bit at a doubled rank)","locator":"Long record Proposition 6.126, p. 79, label record:257bm-i17","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let two supports agree except that the second includes $N+1$ while the first does not. At the argument $2(N+1)$ their divisor counts differ by exactly $1$, because $N+1$ divides $2(N+1)$. More generally the difference at a positive argument $m$ is $\\mathbf1_{N+1\\mid m}$. The linked statements apply this identity to the finite supports in their hypotheses. No conclusion about a different coefficient sequence follows without identifying its own support change.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i17","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i17","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i17%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCylinderFiniteShadow.supportCoeff_insert_divisor%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i17%22%2C%22lean.Erdos249257.HalfCylinderFiniteShadow.supportCoeff_insert_divisor%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/lean.Erdos249257.HalfCylinderFiniteShadow.supportCoeff_insert_divisor"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/nodes/long.record-257bm-i17","id":"sha256:264b08973a5f23b2f98ad989b0c1708096513d86929f19048623a2a9fe18092c/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-i17%22%2C%2